│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The bug is that CHERIoT Ibex continues to use/cache instructions   │
│ through the I-cache while the core is in debug mode.               │
│ That can return stale instructions (or otherwise incorrect fetch   │
│ behavior) during debug flows, which matches upstream Ibex issue    │
│ lowrisc/ibex#1472.                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ From the provided context, the relevant point is in:               │
│                                                                    │
│  • rtl/ibex_if_stage.sv inside gen_icache, where ibex_icache is    │
│    instantiated and receives:                                      │
│     • .icache_enable_i(icache_enable_i)                            │
│                                                                    │
│ ibex_if_stage already has debug_mode_i, but this signal is not     │
│ used to suppress I-cache use.                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the change minimal and local to IF/I-cache control path.   │
│  • Preserve existing CSR-controlled cache enable behavior.         │
│  • Add debug-mode gating at the point where I-cache behavior is    │
│    controlled, rather than broad changes across controller/CSR     │
│    modules.                                                        │
│  • Avoid modifying tests or unrelated logic.                       │
│                                                                    │
│  4 How to fix                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│ Force I-cache disable while in debug mode by gating the I-cache    │
│ enable input:                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Change:                                                         │
│     • icache_enable_i                                              │
│  • To:                                                             │
│     • icache_enable_i & ~debug_mode_i                              │
│                                                                    │
│ This ensures no instruction caching activity is used while         │
│ debugging, aligning behavior with upstream fix intent.             │
