│ directly:                                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • .icache_enable_i ( icache_enable_i )                            │
│                                                                    │
│ This does not account for debug_mode_i, so cache remains active in │
│ debug mode.                                                        │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the change minimal and localized.                          │
│  • Reuse existing control signal (debug_mode_i) already available  │
│    in IF stage.                                                    │
│  • Avoid changing architectural behavior outside debug mode.       │
│  • Ensure cache is effectively disabled while debugging by gating  │
│    enable signal, not by broad logic refactors.                    │
