│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is that when the core enters debug mode, CHERIoT Ibex    │
│ still allows the instruction cache to be used for                  │
│ fetches/allocations.                                               │
│ This can cause stale/incorrect instruction behavior during debug   │
│ operations (the same class of bug fixed upstream in lowRISC Ibex). │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The relevant spot is in rtl/ibex_if_stage.sv inside the I-cache    │
│ instantiation (gen_icache), where:                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  • debug_mode_i is already an input to IF stage.                   │
│  • The I-cache receives .icache_enable_i(icache_enable_i)          │
│    directly.                                                       │
│                                                                    │
│ So cache enable is not masked off in debug mode.                   │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the change minimal and local.                              │
│  • Reuse existing debug signal (debug_mode_i) rather than          │
│    introducing wider interface changes.                            │
│  • Avoid changing behavior outside debug mode.                     │
│  • Keep CSR-controlled cache enable semantics intact, but enforce  │
│    debug override.                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  4 Fix approach                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Create an internal IF-stage signal:                                │
│                                                                    │
│  • icache_enable_internal = icache_enable_i & ~debug_mode_i;       │
│                                                                    │
│ Then connect this internal signal to ibex_icache.icache_enable_i.  │
│                                                                    │
│ This ensures:                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Normal mode: cache works as before.                             │
│  • Debug mode: cache is effectively disabled (no cache             │
│    lookup/allocation behavior), matching upstream intent.          │
