│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The RVFI probe interface expects PMP address CSR arrays as 32-bit  │
│ elements (logic [31:0] ... [PMP_MAX_REGIONS]), but the RTL CSR     │
│ storage/readback for PMP addresses is parameterized by granularity │
│ (PMP_ADDR_WIDTH = 33 - PMP_GRANULARITY when granularity > 0), i.e. │
│ narrower than 32 bits for G != 0.                                  │
│                                                                    │
│ This causes:                                                       │
│                                                                    │
│  • Compile-time type mismatch in simulators with strict checking   │
│    (Xcelium).                                                      │
│  • Incorrect RVFI pmpaddr CSR values (formal CEX) when width       │
│    adaptation is implicit/wrong.                                   │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  • In bhv/cv32e40s_wrapper.sv, RVFI is connected directly to       │
│    core_i.cs_registers_i.pmp_addr_rdata.                           │
│  • In bhv/cv32e40s_rvfi.sv, RVFI currently models PMP address CSR  │
│    inputs as full 32-bit entries, which conflicts with the RTL     │
│    signal type when PMP_GRANULARITY != 0.                          │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep internal RTL storage width-efficient (do not inflate CSR   │
│    internals unnecessarily).                                       │
│  • Ensure RVFI boundary matches producer signal type.              │
│  • Perform explicit, deterministic widening to 32-bit CSR          │
│    representation in one place (RVFI), rather than relying on      │
│    implicit casting.                                               │
│  • Preserve functional meaning: narrowed PMP address value should  │
│    map into CSR value with deterministic low-bit fill.             │
│                                                                    │
│  4 How to fix                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Change RVFI PMP address input probe widths to PMP_ADDR_WIDTH.   │
│  • Explicitly widen to 32 bits in RVFI when driving RVFI CSR       │
│    outputs by appending the required number of low zeros.          │
