│                                                                    │
│ This is not a package-constant problem; it is an AXI interconnect  │
│ plumbing problem where the L2 SPM is connected directly as an AXI  │
│ slave without atomic adaptation.                                   │
│ So the fix must be in the module that wires AXI external slave     │
│ ports to the L2 SPM (Carfield SoC top-level RTL), by inserting     │
│ axi_riscv_atomics_structs before the L2 SPM ports.                 │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices                                                  │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep changes minimal and local to the L2 SPM path.              │
│  • Reuse the same atomics adapter style already used elsewhere in  │
│    the design.                                                     │
│  • Avoid changing address map/enums unless necessary.              │
│  • Preserve existing interfaces by introducing intermediate AXI    │
│    req/rsp signals.                                                │
│                                                                    │
