│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is that AXI atomic operations (ATOP/LR-SC) are not being │
│ converted/handled on the path to the L2 SPM.                       │
│ cheshire already places axi_riscv_atomics_structs in front of:     │
│                                                                    │
│  • main memory,                                                    │
│  • debug module,                                                   │
│  • iDMA slave port.                                                │
│                                                                    │
│ But in carfield, the L2 SPM path is still missing this conversion  │
│ stage, so atomics targeting L2 can fail or be unsupported.         │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where the issue occurs                                          │
│                                                                    │
│ This is not a mapping/constants issue in carfield_pkg.sv; it is a  │
│ data-path integration issue where the AXI slave ports for L2 are   │
│ wired directly to L2 SPM without passing through                   │
│ axi_riscv_atomics_structs.                                         │
│                                                                    │
│ So the fix belongs in the RTL file that connects external AXI      │
│ slave ports to L2 SPM (typically hw/carfield.sv / SoC top          │
│ integration file).                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep existing address map unchanged.                            │
│  • Insert conversion only where missing (before L2 SPM).           │
│  • Reuse existing AXI typedefs/struct wiring style.                │
│  • Preserve interface timing/handshake semantics (adapter in-line  │
│    between existing req/resp channels).                            │
│  • Keep changes minimal and local.                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  4 How to fix                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Add intermediate AXI req/resp signals for each L2 SPM port.     │
│  • Instantiate one axi_riscv_atomics_structs per L2 AXI slave      │
│    port.                                                           │
│  • Connect:                                                        │
│     • Cheshire/external AXI slave side → atomics adapter slave     │
│       interface                                                    │
│     • atomics adapter master interface → L2 SPM AXI interface      │
│                                                                    │
