│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem statement                                               │
│                                                                    │
│ The current stream_join behavior is an “all-at-once” join:         │
│                                                                    │
│  • it always joins all inputs, and                                 │
│  • it only handshakes when all inputs are valid in the same        │
│    transaction window.                                             │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue requests a variant that:                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  • supports a dynamic input selection mask (join only a subset),   │
│  • allows independent input handshakes (inputs may                 │
│    arrive/handshake in different cycles).                          │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where this occurs                                               │
│                                                                    │
│  • The existing infrastructure already has a dynamic counterpart   │
│    for forking (stream_fork_dynamic), but no equivalent for        │
│    joining.                                                        │
│  • Based on provided context, this is mainly a missing IP/module   │
│    feature, not a small bug in existing logic.                     │
│  • Integration points are:                                         │
│     • Bender.yml source list (to compile/export the new IP),       │
│     • README.md cell list (to document the new IP).                │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for fix                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep backward compatibility: do not change stream_join          │
│    semantics.                                                      │
│  • Add a new IP (stream_join_dynamic) rather than modifying        │
│    existing stream_join.                                           │
│  • Use clear ready/valid state handling:                           │
│     • track which selected inputs are still pending,               │
│     • accept selected inputs independently (ready_o[i] high while  │
│       pending),                                                    │
