- `dmi_jtag.sv`: any asynchronous reset usage driven by `trst_no`, plus module ports and reset conditioning.
- `dmi_cdc.sv`: any asynchronous reset or CDC reset gating driven by `trst_no`.
- Any instantiation/wiring site connecting `dmi_jtag_tap` to `dmi_jtag` and `dmi_cdc`, including top-level wrapper(s).
- Any other JTAG/TAP state handling code that might define equivalent reset behavior for consistency.

Since no code was provided, I cannot safely assign exact line numbers without risking inaccuracy.
