│                                                                    │
│  • Follow IEEE 1149.1 TAP reset semantics: active-low TRST must    │
│    put the TAP into Test-Logic-Reset.                              │
│  • Keep the fix minimal and localized.                             │
│  • Preserve unrelated reset behavior for idcode_q and bypass_q     │
