│ The SPI host FSM incorrectly handles a command whose CSID differs  │
│ from the previous command’s CSID.                                  │
│ Instead of entering the CSBSwitch state, it goes to WaitIdle,      │
│ which causes the first command after a CSID change to be           │
│ effectively skipped or mishandled. This breaks the required        │
│ idle/switch timing between devices.                                │
