│                                                                    │
│ Specifically in the WaitIdle state transition logic around the     │
│ decision made when switch_required is true.                        │
│                                                                    │
│ The relevant behavior is:                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • when idle_cntr_q == 0 and a new command is accepted,            │
│  • if the next command uses a different CSID,                      │
│  • the FSM should enter CSBSwitch,                                 │
